s. A separate entrance to the legal basement suite adds versatility. Formerly an art school, it shows its creative roots but can be converted to a conventional suite. Double attached garage with oversized doors plus extra parking. Established neighbourhood across from the Italian Centre and Giovani Caboto Park, near shops and restaurants. MAKE IT YOUR HOME! Or use DC zoning for an art gallery, design studio, aesthetic business or more! (id:67522)","facts":[["Price","$735,000"],["Type","House"],["Bedrooms","3"],["Bathrooms","4"],["Half bathrooms","1"],["Living area","2,749 sq ft"],["Year built","1996"],["Storeys","2"],["Neighbourhood","McCauley"],["Town","Edmonton"],["Postal code","T5H1C5"],["MLS® number","E4514861"],["Listed","October 30, 2026"]],"features":[["Appliances","Washer, Refrigerator, Dishwasher, Stove, Dryer, Hood Fan, Window Coverings"],["Heating","Hot water radiator heat, In Floor Heating"],["Basement","Finished, Full, Suite"],["Parking","Attached Garage, Rear, Oversize"]],"rooms":[["Living room","Main level","3.14 m × 4.34 m (10'4\" × 14'3\")"],["Dining room","Main level","2.74 m × 4.79 m (9'0\" × 15'9\")"],["Kitchen","Main level","5.19 m × 4.57 m (17'0\" × 15'0\")"],["Primary Bedroom","Upper Level","4.31 m × 4.16 m (14'2\" × 13'8\")"],["Bedroom 2","Upper Level","5.40 m × 3.54 m (17'9\" × 11'7\")"],["Bedroom 3","Basement","3.38 m × 3.42 m (11'1\" × 11'3\")"],["Loft","Upper Level","9.19 m × 3.33 m (30'2\" × 10'11\")"],["Media","Upper Level","3.22 m × 5.01 m (10'7\" × 16'5\")"],["Recreation room","Basement","3.38 m × 3.42 m (11'1\" × 11'3\")"],["Second Kitchen","Basement","3.16 m × 3.27 m (10'4\" × 10'9\")"]],"courtesy":"Michael Zisin, Royal LePage Noralta Real Estate","board":"REALTORS® Association of Edmonton","town_slug":"edmonton","hood_slug":"mccauley","area":"central-edmonton"}